{"id":"Xerath","key":"101","name":{"en":"Xerath","zh_TW":"齊勒斯","zh_CN":"泽拉斯"},"title":{"en":"the Magus Ascendant","zh_TW":"遠古魔導","zh_CN":"远古巫灵"},"tags":["Mage","Support"],"icon":"img/champion/Xerath.png","passive":{"name":{"en":"Mana Surge","zh_TW":"祕術強襲","zh_CN":"法力澎湃"},"description":{"en":"Xerath's basic attacks periodically restore Mana. Whenever Xerath kills a unit, this cooldown is reduced.","zh_TW":"齊勒斯的普攻每隔一段時間可以回復魔力。齊勒斯每次擊殺單位，都會減少此技能的冷卻時間。","zh_CN":"泽拉斯的普通攻击会周期性地恢复法力值。每当泽拉斯击杀了一个单位时，这个冷却时间就会缩短。"},"icon":"img/passive/Xerath_Passive1.png"},"spells":[{"slot":"Q","name":{"en":"Arcanopulse","zh_TW":"祕術脈衝","zh_CN":"奥能脉冲"},"description":{"en":"Fires a long-range beam of energy, dealing magic damage to all targets hit.","zh_TW":"發射一道遠距離的能量光束，對所有擊中目標造成魔法傷害。","zh_CN":"泽拉斯聚集能量，随后发射出一道射程很远的能量光束，对所有命中的目标造成魔法伤害。"},"cooldown":"9/8/7/6/5","cost":"80/90/100/110/120","range":"750","icon":"img/spell/XerathArcanopulseChargeUp.png"},{"slot":"W","name":{"en":"Eye of Destruction","zh_TW":"毀滅之眼","zh_CN":"毁灭之眼"},"description":{"en":"Calls down a barrage of arcane energy, slowing and dealing magic damage to all enemies in an area. Targets in the middle receive additional damage and a stronger slow.","zh_TW":"呼喚一波充滿祕術能量的彈幕，對範圍中的所有敵人造成魔法傷害。在技能範圍中央的敵人將會受到額外傷害並且大幅緩速。","zh_CN":"在目标区域降下奥术能量的弹幕，对一个区域内的所有敌人造成减速效果和魔法伤害。区域中心的目标会受到额外伤害和一个更强大的减速效果。"},"cooldown":"14/13/12/11/10","cost":"80/90/100/110/120","range":"1000","icon":"img/spell/XerathArcaneBarrage2.png"},{"slot":"E","name":{"en":"Shocking Orb","zh_TW":"幻魔打擊","zh_CN":"冲击法球"},"description":{"en":"Deals magic damage to an enemy and stuns them.","zh_TW":"暈眩並對敵人造成魔法傷害。","zh_CN":"对单个敌人造成魔法伤害和晕眩效果。"},"cooldown":"13/12.5/12/11.5/11","cost":"60/65/70/75/80","range":"1050","icon":"img/spell/XerathMageSpear.png"},{"slot":"R","name":{"en":"Rite of the Arcane","zh_TW":"魔導祭典","zh_CN":"奥术仪式"},"description":{"en":"Xerath immobilizes himself and gains numerous long-range barrages.","zh_TW":"齊勒斯靜止在原地並遠距離發射魔法光束。","zh_CN":"泽拉斯将自己固定在一处魔力之源上，并获得数次远程施法的机会。"},"